WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.240
Start with the sponsor's chosen outcome.

00:00:02.309 --> 00:00:07.600
Record the metric, target, owner, evidence
and funded cost ceiling before the pilot.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:12.400
A breached quality or authority
floor holds every route.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:17.760
Missing baseline, exposure
or review evidence remains unknown.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:20.800
For an effort-led case,
apply the proposed fifteen

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:23.840
percent threshold and the defined
uncertainty rules.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:28.560
Any cash-saving claim also needs
Finance-validated capture and costs.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:33.200
Quality, reliability, evidence
and reuse cases use their own

00:00:33.246 --> 00:00:37.480
agreed targets; they do not need
an invented cash conversion.

00:00:37.556 --> 00:00:41.360
Adoption, cost limits
and independent review still apply.

00:00:41.531 --> 00:00:45.680
Borderline results may
justify one bounded redesign.

00:00:45.726 --> 00:00:48.240
Freeze the criteria
before seeing the results,

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:50.880
and authorize only the scope
the evidence supports.
